  s0: Not recording | gate off in the page
  s1: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way)
  s2: Wrapping up to pause | gate off in the page
  s3: Paused | gate off in the page
  s4: Paused | gate off in the page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s5: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way) | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s6: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way) | click 1: reached the page#59; report in#59; in the timeline (before 1, after -)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you press Record
  s1 --> s2: you press Stop
  s2 --> s3: the recorder finishes wrapping up
  s3 --> s4: you click (click 1): it reaches the page untouched
  s4 --> s5: you press Continue
  s5 --> s6: Playwright's report for 1 arrives: added to the timeline
